Build qiskit 2.5.2 for WebAssembly (Pyodide 314, wasm32-unknown-emscripten).

- crossterm (terminal size for the text drawer) pulls in mio, which has no wasm
  backend: make it a non-emscripten dependency and assume 80 columns.
- faer's default "rayon" feature pulls in spindle -> atomic-wait, which has no
  emscripten backend: build faer without rayon (Cargo.lock updated to match).
- PrimitiveJob and parallel_map: threads and processes cannot be started under
  Pyodide, so run primitives synchronously and never use process parallelism.

